# ============================================================================
# Author -: HKDEVS
# Project -: Window-Rice
# Title -: WINDOW-RICE Container Testenv Build Context Filters
# ============================================================================
# Keeps the window-rice/testenv build context small WITHOUT dropping anything
# the test suites read:
#   - .git STAYS in the context (tier tests run `git ls-files`)
#   - tracked config payloads (bin/, carapace/, shells/, yasb src+assets+themes
#     +screenshot, installer src, tests/, docker/) all stay
#   - pulse/, rio/, .cargo each carry ONE tracked test-audit target
#     (`pulse/cookie`, `rio/config...`, `.cargo/config.toml`) so they stay
# Excluded = generated build output and untracked local-only third-party dirs.
# ============================================================================

# --- Cargo build output: rebuilt inside the container from scratch ------------
**/target

# --- Accidental backup roots (must never leak host restore data into an image)
.rice-backups
**/.rice-backups

# --- Untracked local-only tool/session data (0 tracked files, heavy) ----------
# Verified via `git ls-files` on 2026-10-29: each of these directories has ZERO
# tracked files, so excluding them cannot break any test audit.
manicode/
kilo/
.agents/
.android/
containers/
opencode/
agents/
forgum/
higgsfield/
omnirush/
raycast/

# --- Untracked shell/terminal runtime state (tracked shell configs live in shells/)
powershell/

# --- Noise ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
